   // ShalillePriestess (Priestess Xiana)
   shalillepriestess_speech_001 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"These things should not even be touched. "
      "Their power to corrupt is almost instantaneous and cannot be undone. "
      "Leave their destruction to the higher powers.\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_002 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bOur most... devoted follower resides in "
      "Barloque. Perhaps you have heard of the gentleman, Meidei.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_003 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"They were a people without the guidance of "
      "Shal'ille.\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_004 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bBlessed Shal'ille provides me with all "
      "that I need.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_005 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bPeace be with you, %s.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_006 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bI have not been to Cor Noth. Is it "
      "nice?~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_007 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bI do not understand the role the council "
      "now plays in the court.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_008 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bEvery six years, we are blessed with a "
      "holiday to our Lady, Shal'ille. It is a time of peace and a time of "
      "giving. Nearly everyone has something they can give to those who have "
      "less than they or are new to the land.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_009 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bI have heard that he has died. How "
      "sad.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_010 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bFaren was blinded by rage at the acts of "
      "Qor. Hopefully, one day he will let our Lady heal his eyes.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_011 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bGreetings, %s. What brings you to the "
      "Temple of Shal'ille?~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_012 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bI teach the magic of Shal'ille, the "
      "goddess of peace.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_013 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bEvery six years, we are blessed with a "
      "holiday to our Lady, Shal'ille. It is a time of peace and a time of "
      "giving. Nearly everyone has something they can give to those who have "
      "less than they or are new to the land.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_014 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"Killing people is wrong, no matter what "
      "justifying reasons there may be. There must be a solution to our "
      "problems without bloodshed.\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_015 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"What is the difference between a venomous "
      "snake and a boa constrictor? Stay away from all things that have to "
      "do with the hunters.\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_016 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bI weep for poor Jala. She was our Lady's "
      "sister and the most beautiful artist and poet in all the land. Our "
      "Lady does indeed miss the sweet sound of Jala's songs.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_017 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bI know very little of the towns.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_018 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bKraanan is the husband and master of my "
      "lady Shal'ille. He is the first of the six. Praise be to Kraanan the "
      "Fist.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_019 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bI teach the magic of Shal'ille, the "
      "goddess of peace.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_020 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bLong ago, during the Barloque/Tos wars, a "
      "legion of Tos soldiers came through Marion intent on using it as a "
      "base to house troops until they were ready to embark out on the great "
      "ocean and take Barloque by surprise from the north. The Priestess and "
      "all of the villagers prayed for Shal'ille to fold her protective arms "
      "about the town so that it would not suffer the indignities of war. "
      "Their prayers were answered and still to this day Shal'ille watches "
      "over them.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_021 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bMeidei is certainly enthusiastic, but I "
      "do believe that he tries too hard. Our goddess does not demand "
      "worship, as he feels.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_022 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bThrough the eyes of Shal'ille I see how "
      "lonely her existence is, though I can interpret neither her words nor "
      "her deeds.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_023 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bTake my hands, we shall pray to Shal'ille "
      "so that she gives us the strength to do what is necessary, what is "
      "right.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_024 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bHer lies have caused some unrest? Do not "
      "let yourself be swayed by her ungodly ways.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_025 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bUnfortunately we all dismissed Tenuval's "
      "warnings as paranoid babble. Now that Miriana has shown her true "
      "intentions, we know that Tenuval was not paranoid enough.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_026 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bDo not speak her cursed name in this "
      "temple of peace and goodwill.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_027 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bLady Shal'ille sees the necessity of her "
      "demise, and though she must shed tears over the violence of this act, "
      "she knows it is the only way to free us from Miriana's madness.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_028 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"These creatures know no mercy or humanity. "
      "They exist to destroy life. They are utterly blind to the ways of "
      "Shal'ille.\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_029 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bThe nodes have obviously defended "
      "themselves against her attacks, otherwise they would no longer "
      "exist.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_030 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bThe worst consequences arise from the "
      "actions that seem random.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_031 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bShe must be stopped. The nodes seem to be "
      "fine, but one can never know when Miriana will have had enough. We "
      "cannot take the risk of letting her continue.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_032 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana bows her head and says, \"~bLet us pray together. "
      "Lady Shal'ille, listen to our prayers for peace and prosperity to all "
      "the good people of the world.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_033 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bHow is Kat? She visits me from time to "
      "time, when she can pull herself away from the needs of her "
      "kingdom.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_034 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bAlas, Qor is the fallen one. She only "
      "need seek redemption from our Lady Shal'ille and I am certain she "
      "will receive it.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_035 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bI do not know what became of Riija. "
      "Probably off playing tricks on the unaware someplace.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_036 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bSalvation is not for sale. Shal'ille "
      "grants it freely.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_037 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bOur Lady Shal'ille is the goddess of all "
      "that is good and peaceful. She resides in the babbling brook, the "
      "calm wind and the gentle rain. Praise be her name.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_038 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bI fear Shal'ille has no need of students "
      "at this time.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_039 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"I pray for his soul every time I think of "
      "his tragedy.\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_040 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bLord Kraanan has many followers in Tos "
      "and therefore it must be a great city.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_041 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"Without faith in the harmony of all things, "
      "we are all more likely to turn towards that which promises the easy "
      "solution.  Venya'cyr took the easy path to her desires and it cost "
      "her eternal soul.\""
   shalillepriestess_speech_042 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"If he had not survived, the course of "
      "history would surely be different.\""
   shalillepriestess_random_001 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bThe living trees of Faronath are peaceful "
      "beings. They serve Shal'ille.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_002 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bLittle Miriana speaks lies about our "
      "Lady. She is best avoided.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_003 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bMaleval is a monster. He speaks nothing "
      "but lies.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_004 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bThere is little reason to fear good "
      "creatures if you are good yourself.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_005 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bKilling monsters is far more acceptable "
      "than killing other humans. Murder is the fastest way to fall from "
      "good graces.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_006 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bMany do not realize that there is "
      "retribution to killing. Often a horrible spirit will manifest and "
      "seek revenge for the innocent victim.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_007 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bThose who are good in nature will be "
      "blessed with a gift, should they fall prey to the Underworld.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_008 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bMastering the teachings of Shal'ille is "
      "easier if your mind is cleared of the influences of other gods. A "
      "potion of Forgetfulness can aid, but it usually has some ill side "
      "effects.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_009 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bIn Tos, there is an Arena dedicated to "
      "our Lady's husband. The fights are mock, so you need not fear death "
      "within.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_010 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bThe God Days of Shal'ille are truly a "
      "joyous and peaceful holiday around the whole of the land.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_011 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bIn the north corner of the temple is the "
      "pool of serenity. Bathe in the water and find the peace within you. "
      "Take a few moments to release the frustrations of the day and realize "
      "you are in this world but to relax. No problem here is worth getting "
      "truly wrought over.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_012 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bIn the south corner of the temple is the "
      "pool of redemption. Kneel before it and give forgiveness to your "
      "least favored person for they do not mean to truly cause you pain; "
      "they just come from a different point of view. Do not hold the weight "
      "of a useless grudge or it is you alone who suffers.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_013 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bSome say I am faulted for acquiescing to "
      "the wishes of Kraanan. Men have much strength of hand and must be "
      "respected, but the power of Peace and Rebirth lies within the soul of "
      "women.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_014 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bPraise be Shal'ille the Calm!~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_015 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bOur Lady smiles on you.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_016 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bMay Shal'ille grant gentle rains to your "
      "fields.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_017 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bMay you find peace in the contemplation "
      "of our Lady.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_018 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bThose who prove themselves to be the most "
      "worthy, shall be blessed by our Lady with additional aid to their "
      "castings.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_019 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bLegend has it that the gods martyred "
      "themselves out in the Holy Land of Trolls when the Nexus collapsed "
      "hundreds of years ago.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_020 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bThe dead should be honored. Placing "
      "flowers at a memorial site is more for the spiritual benefit of those "
      "living than for the deceased.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_random_021 = \
      "~kPriestess Xiana says, \"~bI am appalled at the blasphemous things "
      "that Miriana says about Shal'ille and Faren. The girl should be "
      "flogged. Oh, forgive me, Shal'ille for saying such an awful thing.~k\""
   shalillepriestess_trigger_amulet = "amulet"
   shalillepriestess_trigger_barloque = "barloque"
   shalillepriestess_trigger_brax = "brax"
   shalillepriestess_trigger_sell = "sell"
